-- stale: ["What the character window shows behind everything: its own stone, or stone, cracked concrete, iron plate, leather or dark. Parchment is Oldschool > Parchment's Character Window: under the right pane, or over the whole window (on its own stone, whatever this shows). The equipment slots, the progress bars and the side tabs wear the borders of Oldschool > Borders (every window's)."] = "O que a janela do personagem mostra atrás de tudo: a própria pedra, ou pedra, concreto rachado, placa de ferro, couro ou escuro. O pergaminho é a Janela do personagem de Oldschool > Pergaminho: sob o painel direito, ou sobre a janela inteira (sobre a própria pedra, seja o que for que isto mostre). Os compartimentos de equipamento, as barras de progresso e as abas laterais usam as bordas de Oldschool > Bordas (as de cada janela).", -- draft
